              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                Are the quizzes free and without registration?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Every quiz is free and plays without an account. Signing up is free too, and only serves to keep your scores and compare them with friends.</p>
            </details>
            <details name="faq" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md open:shadow-md open:border-violet-200 transition-all">
              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                What types of quizzes do you offer?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">There are five categories so far, one quiz each: sports with football, geography with world flags, anime with Dragon Ball, cinema with Harry Potter and video games with Minecraft. That is 71 questions in total, and more are on the way.</p>
            </details>
            <details name="faq" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md open:shadow-md open:border-violet-200 transition-all">
              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                Can quizzes help with revision?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">You remember something better when you have to retrieve it yourself than when you reread a page, and that is what a quiz does. Every answer is explained. That said, the quizzes here are about general knowledge and hobbies, not about a school syllabus.</p>
            </details>
            <details name="faq" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md open:shadow-md open:border-violet-200 transition-all">
              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                What are the different game modes available?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">The mode available today is the four-answer multiple choice, with three bonuses to get you out of a hard question. Five more modes are built and waiting on quizzes: true or false, chrono, estimation, duel and chronological order.</p>
            </details>
            <details name="faq" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md open:shadow-md open:border-violet-200 transition-all">
              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                How do I create my own quiz on Wizyquizz?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">You pick a category, add your questions with their answers and explanations, and the quiz goes online. You then get a link to share it.</p>
            </details>
            <details name="faq" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md open:shadow-md open:border-violet-200 transition-all">
              <summary class="px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                Does Wizyquizz work on mobile and tablet?
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width={2}><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="px-5 pb-4 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Wizyquizz is fully responsive and optimized for all screens. You can play on smartphone, tablet or desktop with the same experience. No app to download, everything works directly in your browser.</p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

